OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal as rider dies weeks after
OL,4,Amotorcycle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has died several weeks
OL,7,Fafter a crash involving two motorbikes
OL,8,Fin North Yorkshire, police have said.
OL,10,FThe collision happened on Mook Street,
OL,11,Fnear Westow, at 10:35 BST on 2 August.
OL,13,FBoth riders were airlifted to hospital
OL,14,Fwith serious injuries after the crash.
OL,16,FNorth Yorkshire Police said one of the
OL,17,Fmen had since died following a short
OL,18,Fperiod in hospice care.
